stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Candidate: SIGHUP · PUT /v1/config
  Candidate --> Rejected: parse error · restart_required · stale revision · missing vhost file
  Candidate --> Published: exact revision recheck passes
  Rejected --> [*]: serving generation untouched
  Published --> Serving
  Serving --> Retiring: a newer generation publishes
  Retiring --> [*]: in-flight requests finish on their pinned generation
  note right of Published
    caches keyed by epoch + generation:
    old renders cannot overwrite new entries
  end note
